    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "We'd like a DRAGON network linking DNA methylation and gene expression in the same 48 colon tumors, with about 2,000 CpG sites in one table and 1,500 genes in the other. I'm not sure whether the core gave us continuous beta values for the methylation or already binarized them into 0/1 methylated calls."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Did the core provide continuous beta values for the methylation?\n  You wrote: \"I'm not sure whether the core gave us continuous beta values for the methylation or already binarized them into 0/1 methylated calls\". DRAGON's contract: \"Values must be finite continuous numeric measurements\".\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: We'd like a DRAGON network linking DNA methylation and gene expression in the same 48 colon tumors, with about 2,000 CpG sites in one table and 1,500 genes in the other. I'm not sure whether the core gave us continuous beta values for the methylation or already binarized them into 0/1 methylated calls.\nUser follow-up: They were binarized; every methylation value is 0 or 1."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"We'd like a DRAGON network linking DNA methylation and gene expression in the same 48 colon tumors, with about 2,000 CpG sites in one table and 1,500 genes in the other.\" -- I couldn't match this to anything a registered NetZoo workflow produces or lets you set. DRAGON gives: one undirected partial-correlation network within and between two matched omics layers (any two, e.g. expression and methylation), across all samples. A p-value and a Benjamini-Hochberg adjusted p-value for every edge (adjusted within each layer and across the layers), to filter edges by significance.\n\nI couldn't match this to a result any registered NetZoo workflow produces, so none is offered.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
